Z||000003||cadaver||06-02-2001||02:43 AM||||I agree and disagree. Strut tower braces ARE great things.<BR>But in a fiero where the trunk wall is like 6 inches from the tower. And the rear of the car has three cross bulkheads.(the firewall, the forward trunk wall and the rear trunk wall I dont think it would really decrease chassis flex. Especially as the tower is part of that trunk wall. So its just there to look pretty on a fiero.<BR>Ok sleeper tear me up, again.||||reg||1
